cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and the papers listed under Citing this work in the README."
type: software
title: "polynetopo: topology, shortest-path and spatial betweenness analysis for crosslinked polymer networks"
abstract: >-
  polynetopo analyzes the topology of crosslinked polymer networks: the elastically
  effective strands, dangling chains and loops with the Scanlan-Case refinement of the
  crosslinker density, the shortest paths that wrap through the periodic box, and the
  geodesic, orientation-weighted and distance-weighted edge betweenness of every bond.
